<span class="line"><span>                        &lt;platform-specific&gt;&lt;html&gt;&lt;html-template location=&quot;component://mycomponent/webapp/mycomponent/test/test.ftl&quot;/&gt;&lt;/html&gt;&lt;/platform-specific&gt;</span></span>
